SUMMARY:[TACAS 27] R1 Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://etaps.org/2027/
 cfp/\n\nTACAS is a track of ETAPS 2027.\n\nThe four main conferences of E
 TAPS 2027 solicit contributions. ESOP accepts regular research papers (ma
 x 25 pp)\, experience reports (max 15 pp)\, and fresh perspectives (max 1
 5 pp). FoSSaCS accepts regular research papers (max 18 pp). TACAS accepts
  regular research papers\, case study papers\, and regular tool papers (m
 ax 18 pp)\, and tool demonstration papers (max 6 pp). All page limits exc
 lude the bibliography. Submissions must be in English\, original\, unpubl
 ished\, and not submitted elsewhere. Simultaneous submission is forbidden
 . ESOP\, TACAS\, and FoSSaCS use an author rebuttal phase. Data availabil
 ity statements are mandatory. Double-blind reviewing applies to TACAS and
  iFS regular research papers.\n\nhttps://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-confere
 nces
